WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.882
The practice section moves from simple tasks toward
small integrated problems The goal

00:00:05.908 --> 00:00:10.434
is not to write a large program The goal is to
combine a few ideas

00:00:10.461 --> 00:00:15.614
at a time and be able to explain what each line does
As you work

00:00:15.917 --> 00:00:21.196
use the same cycle we have used throughout the
module Read the task predict what

00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:27.260
the code should do run it modify one part and
explain the result If

00:00:27.286 --> 00:00:32.973
your answer is different from what you expected do
not immediately replace your code First

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:38.644
inspect the variables and intermediate calculations
Learning to trace a small program

00:00:38.657 --> 00:00:43.013
is one of the best foundations for debugging larger
analytical workflows later
